			<div class="content" id="post-content-3585409">
									

<p>This was really interesting, but I found some of the crosslinks distracting/excessive. The log entry about creating 2315 was really unexpected to the point of feeling like a non-sequitur, as I figured it would be something biological or medical, or otherwise related in theme,. Also, I feel like the redactions in the log were a bit excessive and didn't really add much.</p>
