<li>The whole 'give me back my fucking test subjects' bit comes off as slightly forced to show how angry this thing is. I already got the impression it was deranged.</li>
</ul>
<p>Other than that, really enjoyed. Artificial intelligence that tries to do what's best for humanity but ends up screwing up and making things worse is one of my favorite tropes, and the writing is spectacular.</p>

